---
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Outsourcing | CreditSoft" description="Why offices can rely less on outsourcing when the internal system already organizes the work.">
	<PageHero
		eyebrow="Outsourcing"
		title="If the software automates better, you should need less outsourcing, not more."
		copy="CreditSoft’s angle is not that every office will never outsource again. It is that the system should reduce the amount of work that gets handed off just because the software never narrowed the lane."
	/>

	<section class="section">
		<div class="proof-grid">
			<article class="proof-block">
				<h2>Fewer generic queues</h2>
				<p>Client letters, tasks, and recommendations should already reflect the file, which lowers how much review gets kicked outside the office.</p>
			</article>
			<article class="proof-block">
				<h2>More operator context</h2>
				<p>The office sees what to do next and why, instead of paying for someone else to interpret every case from scratch.</p>
			</article>
			<article class="proof-block">
				<h2>Better transition path</h2>
				<p>If you outsource today, the site intake should still ask about it, because that’s part of the migration plan and ROI story.</p>
			</article>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
